@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：AI 客服對話與升級轉真人客服

actor 使用者 as User
participant "AiSupportScreen" as UI
participant "ApiService(AiApi)" as ApiSvc
participant "POST /api/ai/support/messages" as Route
participant "ai/support.js" as SupportAi
participant "AI 供應商" as LLM
participant "support.js" as SupportSvc
database "Prisma / MariaDB" as DB

User -> UI : 輸入問題
UI -> ApiSvc : sendAiSupportMessage(message)
ApiSvc -> Route : POST /api/ai/support/messages
Route -> SupportAi : sendMessage(userId, message)
SupportAi -> SupportAi : runner.access('support')\nconsent.assertGranted()\nassertDailyLimit()
SupportAi -> DB : 讀取 faqs / legal_documents\n讀取本人最近5筆訂單與預約狀態
SupportAi -> SupportAi : buildSystem(平台規則+FAQ+使用者情境)
SupportAi -> LLM : 呼叫模型
LLM --> SupportAi : { reply, suggest_handoff }
SupportAi -> DB : ai_support_sessions/ai_support_messages 寫入
SupportAi --> UI : 顯示AI回覆

alt AI建議轉真人 或 使用者主動要求
  User -> UI : 點擊「轉真人客服」
  UI -> ApiSvc : escalateAiSupport()
  ApiSvc -> Route : POST /api/ai/support/session/escalate
  Route -> SupportAi : escalate(sessionId)
  SupportAi -> SupportSvc : open(userId, subject, 對話逐字稿)
  SupportSvc -> DB : support_tickets.create()\n+ support_ticket_messages.create()
  SupportSvc -> DB : notifySupportStaff(可管理客服之管理員)
  SupportAi -> DB : ai_support_sessions.status='escalated'\n(記錄ticket_id)
  SupportAi --> UI : 導向真人客服工單畫面
end
@enduml
